window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>Dive in for the first time or delve deeper into the bestselling Hot Scots series with three steamy novellas in one collection.</i></b><br> <br> <b>The Notorious Dr. MacT</b><br> <br> Their forbidden attraction is undeniable, but giving in could make them both notorious. Scottish Professor Iain and American student Rae must remain only friends—until she passes her final exams and is technically no longer a student. But one night changes everything and ruins them both. Then Iain vanishes. Will he ever know the secret she keeps?<br> <br> <b>The British Bastard</b><br> <br> When a sweet Scot meets a hot Brit with a mysterious past, can she resist the irresistible? Professor Alex never lets anyone into his life or his heart—until grad student Catriona arrives on campus. She wants to know him, but he needs to hide his true self. When their relationship blows apart, they believe they will never see each other again. But fate has its own plans.<br> <br> <b>How to Lose a Lass</b><br> <br> When a former Marine and a Scottish lass meet, it's lust at first sight. But Gavin never counted on Jamie's family butting into their budding romance. His old wounds, her burly brothers, and the stress of their intercontinental romance keep getting in the way. Can love win out, or will their romance blow apart?<br> <br> <b>The Hot Scots Prequel Novellas gathers these three stories in one book. Don't miss the books that complete these romances—</b><b><i>Gift-Wrapped in a Kilt</i></b><b> (Book Four), </b><b><i>Notorious in a Kilt</i></b><b> (Book Five), and </b><b><i>Irresistible in a Kilt</i></b><b> (Book Eight).</b></p>"; 
